sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Ext as Browser Extension
    participant NMH as native_messaging_host
    participant Svc as remo-service
    participant Core as remo-core
    participant DB as SQLite

    User->>Ext: Clicks download link
    Ext->>Ext: Intercepts request (webRequest API)
    Ext->>NMH: JSON {action: addDownload, url, referrer}
    NMH->>NMH: Validate message
    NMH->>Svc: Forward request through IPC
    Svc->>Svc: CategoryManager.classify(fileName)
    Svc->>Core: Create DownloadTask
    Core->>Core: fetchHeaders() checks size and Range support
    Core->>DB: INSERT INTO downloads, segments
    Core-->>Svc: DownloadTask created (status=queued)
    Svc-->>NMH: Confirm add
    NMH-->>Ext: JSON {success: true, downloadId}
    Ext-->>User: Toast "Download started"
    Svc->>Core: start() when queue slot is available
    Core->>Core: SegmentPlanner.planSegments()
    loop for each Segment
        Core->>Core: SegmentWorker.run() in parallel
        Core->>DB: Update downloaded_bytes in batches
    end
    Core-->>Svc: DownloadEvent(completed)
    Svc->>Svc: NotificationDispatcher.publish()
    Svc-->>User: System notification "Download completed"

